        "id": 12410,
        "name": "AlexxKay",
        "username": "AlexxKay",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/59ef9b/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-23T06:02:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It has already been well established that Fixed Point will allow Hero Character cards to evade destruction by healing back above 0 HP before Fixed Point leaves play.<br><br>What about cards OTHER than Hero Characters?&nbsp; Lots of Hero and Villan Targets have the potential to be healed.&nbsp; Do they also get to stay alive if above 0 when FP leaves?&nbsp; It seems to me that they should, but the prior discussions (that I found) and Spiff's FAQ don't seem to cover this case.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:43:56.913Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
