        "raw": "<p>It has already been well established that Fixed Point will allow Hero Character cards to evade destruction by healing back above 0 HP before Fixed Point leaves play.<br /><br />What about cards OTHER than Hero Characters?&nbsp; Lots of Hero and Villan Targets have the potential to be healed.&nbsp; Do they also get to stay alive if above 0 when FP leaves?&nbsp; It seems to me that they should, but the prior discussions (that I found) and Spiff&#39;s FAQ don&#39;t seem to cover this case.</p>",
